sequenceDiagram
  participant C as n8n
  participant M as MCP server
  participant R as Reports (read-only)
  participant A as Audit log
  C->>M: tools/call (bearer token)
  M->>M: auth, rate limit, allowlist
  M->>R: read report (validated name)
  R-->>M: text, max 64 KiB
  M->>A: one JSON line, no secrets
  M-->>C: result
